  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Schools Assistance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian grant to Rural Support Programme Network for repair/rehabilitation of 845 schools, capacity building of teachers and provide kits (books, stationary &amp; bags) to at least 158,000 boys and girls from the floods affected districts of South Punjab, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and Sindh.</narrative>
  </description>
